//   3. Redeploy (or just save — Amplify Hosting auto-deploys on git push)
// =============================================================================

// each work will have the following information
// id: how application names piece
// title: work title
// section: Where on the site do you want this information
// project name: what project this is associated with
// description: artist statement
// date: yyyyMMdd the work was completed
// tags: for search algorithm
// thumbnail: video cover/image cover path
// video: video path


